# Lifecycle (master)
// "Lifecycle" in the Linear doc "Workspaces API contract". Warehouse calls, the sidecar boot
// (MB_CONFIG_FILE_PATH=config.yml) and transform runs are not API operations, so they are not steps.
mbcode -> parent: createWorkspace {id, databases.database_id, databases.status, databases.output_namespace}
mbcode -> parent: getWorkspaceConfig
mbcode -> sidecar: getCurrentWorkspace {data}
mbcode -> parent: deleteWorkspace
